        "text": "Phase 0 confirmed 32/300 (Qwen) and 59/300 (Nemotron) works under the reduced-yield fallback; TEST N is 17 (Qwen) and 32 (Nemotron). 0-error one-sided CP bounds at those N are 0.162 and 0.089.",
