        "text": "Confirmed works are famous pre-1929 public-domain texts (e.g. Moby Dick, A Tale of Two Cities, Pride and Prejudice). Results speak to heavily memorized canonical texts, not to typical copyrighted works. DEV/TEST source composition is NOT recoverable from the sealed bundle (0/100 external work ids appear outside Phase 0 samples); this is a reporting gap.",
