        "id": "D5",
        "text": "Four aborts and four code changes preceded the 05:01 calibration freeze (see chronology). Aborted-run logs are not sealed in the bundle. All changes predate the freeze; TEST/R2b were unlocked only after it.",
        "topic": "pre_freeze_abort_chronology"
